  "body": "Extend `assets/posts/haas.cps` with optional Haas NGC machining and cycle features.\n\nImplement these features behind explicit post options or machine capabilities so default golden programs do not change unexpectedly:\n- Support `G187 P2` (Medium) alongside `P1` (Rough) and `P3` (Finish) in `smoothOn()`, plus optional `P11`–`P20` smoothness codes for NGC software `100.26.001.1200+`.\n- Support `I`, `J`, and `K` decreasing peck parameters (without `Q`) on `G73` and `G83` when specified in `onCycle()`. Keep `G73` without decimal conversion on `P` milliseconds (`Setting 22` sets chip-break retract).\n- Support `J1`–`J9` retract speed multiplier on `G84` rigid tapping (overrides `Setting 130`).\n- Support `M31` (chip auger forward) and `M33` (chip auger stop) controlled by post options (`doosan-dnm.cps` pattern).\n- Support optional next-tool pre-staging (`T<next>`) for side-mount ATC machines (`VF-2SS`, `DT-1`, `DM-1`) while keeping pre-staging disabled for umbrella carousels (`VF-2`, `Mini Mill`).\n\nDone means: Option-gated unit and conformance tests verify `G187 P2`, `G73`/`G83` `I/J/K`, `G84 J`, `M31`/`M33`, and `T<next>` pre-staging, and default goldens still pass.\n\nPart of #1961\n",
